{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1813","id":4180057863,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p875Jp8H","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1813","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1813.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1813.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1813","number":1813,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[9709][P6-06] Publish terminal Paper 6 semantic KG","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1804\nParent: #1798\nPredecessor: #1803\n\n## Summary\n\nPublishes the bounded terminal Probability & Statistics 2 semantic KG release for 2020–2025 Paper 6.\n\n- Authenticates the complete #1799–#1803 successor chain, including the P6-02/P6-03 delayed repair PRs.\n- Assigns terminal dispositions to all 286 Questions and 920 QuestionParts.\n- Reconciles 10 foreign-family predecessor dispositions through direct QP/MS pixel review.\n- Canonicalizes 42 ProcedureModels and validates 763 ProcedureInstances, 269 supporting instances, 200 cross-P5 instances, and 12 alternative branches.\n- Publishes eight bounded terminal artifacts plus the indexed Chinese production report.\n- Preserves candidate/abstain isolation and all historical predecessor bytes.\n\n## Terminal readback\n\n- Questions: 286 / 286 (224 approved, 52 candidate, 10 abstain)\n- QuestionParts: 920 / 920 (482 approved, 160 candidate, 278 abstain)\n- Score-owning / instruction-only: 686 / 234\n- QuestionTypes / ProcedureModels / ProcedureInstances: 45 / 42 / 763\n- QP / MS images: 420 / 540; 960 / 960 hash-authenticated and decoded\n- Missing, unreadable, or mismatched images: 0\n- Cross-P5 reuse conflicts: 0\n- Approved singleton models without rationale: 0\n- Text-only approvals: 0\n- Deterministic active / terminal / rollback replay: PASS\n- Remote writes: 0\n\nVisual review duration was not instrumented and is intentionally reported as null.\n\n## Reconciliation highlights\n\nTwo P6-06 adjudications were added after opening their QP/MS crops at original resolution:\n\n- S25/62 q01/a: fair-die allocation, reusing the approved P5 discrete distribution model.\n- S25/62 q05: upper-tail 5% normal sample-mean test with z=1.645 and critical mean 12.5.\n\nEight further parts already reviewed by P6-04 were reconciled without changing immutable Family artifacts.\n\n## Verification\n\n- python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1804_p6_terminal_reconciliation.test.py — 16/16 PASS\n- python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1803_p6_hypothesis_tests_semantic_kg.test.py — 10/10 PASS\n- python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1791_p5_terminal_reconciliation.test.py — 12/12 PASS\n- python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py — 31/31 PASS\n- python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1804_p6_terminal_reconciliation.py --check — deterministic rebuild and replay PASS\n- npm run quality:report-index — PASS, 0 violations\n- git diff --check origin/main...HEAD — PASS\n\n## Review repairs\n\n- Registers exactly eight P6 terminal artifacts in the bounded future-producer allowlist.\n- Authenticates every recorded review head/tree, merge tree, and merge-parent relationship against Git objects.\n- Rejects PNG IDAT streams with missing EOF, trailing compressed data, or unconsumed data.\n- Classifies all six cross-P5 primary QuestionType relationships and regenerates dependent receipts/manifests.\n- Full focused matrix: 69/69 PASS.\n\nCurrent-head GitHub CI and independent exact-head review are rerunning. A prior Backend/platform ESLint job failed before diagnostics because its self-hosted checkout did not materialize the unchanged tracked config; the sibling ESLint job and local backend/platform lint passed. Merge, exact-main replay/readback, issue closeout, and governed cleanup remain mandatory before final live-main closeout.","created_at":"2026-07-31T18:32:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T19:18:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T19:12:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T19:12:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"e5ece5eb88cce2611f54119e052da7c292a64f22","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1813/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1813/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1813/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/21387bd52b056579f4d94e6c6a58be64644fa37b","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1804-paper6-terminal-reconciliation","ref":"task/1804-paper6-terminal-reconciliation","sha":"21387bd52b056579f4d94e6c6a58be64644fa37b","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","htm